EN:
You think {{TAG:0003:0017:}}I could ever grow to be
on speaking terms with insects?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I guess it'd just take a lot of time{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

{{TAG:0003:0024:}}If you take a close look at bugs,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
they all look kind of like little
nightmares, right,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Si miras los bichos bien de cerca,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
todos tienen un aspecto muuuucho
más repulsivo, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Este no es el sitio más indicado
para venir solo si los bichos
te dan repelús{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Credo che questo sia il posto
peggiore in cui rimanere soli
se si ha paura degli insetti{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Con razón dicen "es un bicho"
cuando alguien no para quieto{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡Tiene todo el sentido del mundo!
